# Tailscale clinic — Jetson reaches VPS over tailnet; desk uses Funnel HTTPS.
# Copy to lab.env on Mac (deploy) and Jetson (~/.../deploy/env/lab.env).
#
# 1. On VPS: deploy/vps/tailscale_clinic_up.sh
# 2. On VPS: deploy/vps/set_site_clinic_config.sh
# 3. On Jetson: install Tailscale + join same tailnet, then start_station.sh
# 4. On Mac: deploy/mac/start_clinic_mic.sh (mic stays on MacBook — not Jetson USB)
# 5. Skip Mac LAN bridge:  # ./mac_lan_bridge.sh

